  "title": "Rogers Turns on Free Rogers Satellite to all B.C. Wireless Customers During Wildfires",
  "summary": "First Canadian carrier to pilot how satellite-to-mobile technology enhances safety during emergencies VANCOUVER (August 13, 2026)–Rogers Communications today announced it has opened up Rogers Satellite province-wide for all Rogers wireless customers in British Columbia as wildfires continue to spread. “We’re committed to helping British Columbians affected by these devastating wildfires,” […]",
